# Mandurang — one of the Dragons of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 9/12 The Dragons — 24 life, bribe 110 gold
# enemy: Mandurang (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0990.dck "Mandurang (R/U/B, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink
#   3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 18 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 24 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/mandurang.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 9)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/mandurang.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Dragons) — "Mandurang" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Mandurang
2 Carrion Ants
4 Zephyr Falcon
4 Will-o'-the-Wisp
4 Dancing Scimitar
4 Ornithopter
2 Celestial Prism
6 Mountain
6 Swamp
6 Island
1 Mox Ruby
1 Mox Jet
1 Mox Sapphire
2 Jayemdae Tome
4 Giant Strength
4 Unstable Mutation
4 Unholy Strength
1 Braingeyser
1 Blood Lust
3 Cursed Land
# The 1997 file's colour-keyed sideboard sections. The AI played the maindeck WITHOUT
# .vNone plus the one section matching the player's deck colour (.vNone by default);
# .vNone is folded into the maindeck above, and SB: holds, per name, the largest
# colour-section count minus the .vNone count — the smallest sideboard from which
# every 1997 configuration can be rebuilt by swapping.
#   .vNone   3 Cursed Land
#   .vBlack  3 Bog Wraith
#   .vBlue   3 Red Elemental Blast
#   .vGreen  2 Deathgrip, 1 Lifetap
#   .vRed    3 Blue Elemental Blast
#   .vWhite  1 Gloom, 2 Flashfires
SB: 3 Bog Wraith
SB: 3 Red Elemental Blast
SB: 2 Deathgrip
SB: 1 Lifetap
SB: 3 Blue Elemental Blast
SB: 1 Gloom
SB: 2 Flashfires
